sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User settings
    participant P as Policy and journal
    participant B as Broker
    participant X as Native or remote execution
    B->>P: Prepare action under revision N
    P-->>B: Bound context and expected revisions
    U->>P: Narrow scope or revoke grant
    P->>P: Commit N plus 1 and cancellation intent
    alt Change wins before admission
        B->>P: Recheck immediately before effect
        P-->>B: Reject stale authority
        B-->>X: No dispatch
    else Action already admitted
        B->>X: Cancel admitted work
        X-->>B: Observation or missing response
        B->>P: Reconcile actual outcome
        P-->>U: Committed or stopped or Unknown
    end
    alt Native process holds broader rights
        P->>X: Fence broker and terminate owned processes
        X-->>P: Verified stop or uncertainty
        P-->>U: Effective narrow mode only after verified stop
    else No wider native process
        P-->>U: New effective policy revision
    end
